{"seq":85,"slug":"nim-language","title":"Nim 语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Nim 语言\n\nNim 是一门静态类型、编译型系统编程语言，由 Andreas Rumpf 于 2008 年发布首个自举版本，至 2026 年已迭代至 2.2.x 稳定线。它的设计哲学可以用三个词概括：效率、表达力、优雅——按此优先级排列。Nim 将 Python 风格的缩进语法与接近 C 的运行时性能结合，同时提供了可与 Lisp 宏媲美的编译期元编程能力，形成了一个在系统编程语言中独特的交叉定位。\n\n与本仓库中的兄弟 hub 相比，Nim 的边界如下：**rust-language** 聚焦所有权与借用检查器驱动的内存安全模型；**zig-language** 强调显式 allocator 与零隐式开销的可控性；**c-language-programming** 是手动内存管理与最小抽象的基准参照；**cpp-fundamentals** 覆盖 RAII、模板元编程与多范式面向对象。Nim 则走了一条不同的路：通过 ARC/ORC 引用计数实现确定性内存管理（无 stop-the-world 暂停），通过宏和模板实现零成本的编译期代码生成，并且能编译到 C、C++、JavaScript 等多种后端——这些特性的组合使其在同类语言中独树一帜。\n\n本 hub 推荐的学习路径：先从「基础」章节掌握语法、类型系统与内存管理模型，建立对 Nim 运行时行为的基本认知；然后进入「元编程」章节理解模板、宏与编译期执行的分层能力；接着通过「互操作与性能」章节学会与 C/C++ 和 JavaScript 生态互联并进行性能调优；最后在「生态系统」章节了解包管理、异步编程与实际应用场景。\n\n前置知识：至少一门系统编程语言（C/C++/Rust/Go）的基本经验，理解编译与运行时的区别，对引用计数与垃圾回收有初步概念。\n\n---\n\n延伸阅读：\n\n- [Rust 语言](../03_rust-language/_INTRODUCTION.md) — 所有权模型与借用检查\n- [Zig 语言](../25_zig-language/_INTRODUCTION.md) — 显式 allocator 与编译期计算\n- [C 语言编程](../17_c-language-programming/_INTRODUCTION.md) — 手动内存管理基础\n- [C++ 基础](../08_cpp-fundamentals/_INTRODUCTION.md) — RAII 与模板元编程\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"syntax-type-system","title":"Nim 语法与类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/fundamentals/syntax-type-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"Nim 内存管理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/fundamentals/memory-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"control-flow-iterators","title":"Nim 控制流与迭代器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/fundamentals/control-flow-iterators"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"metaprogramming","title":"元编程篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macros-templates","title":"Nim 宏与模板系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/macros-templates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compile-time-execution","title":"Nim 编译期执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/compile-time-execution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pragmas-effects","title":"Nim Pragma 与效果系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/pragmas-effects"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"interop-performance","title":"互操作与性能篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"c-cpp-interop","title":"Nim C/C++ 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/c-cpp-interop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"javascript-backend","title":"Nim JavaScript 后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/javascript-backend"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"Nim 性能优化实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/performance-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ecosystem","title":"生态系统篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nimble-package-manager","title":"Nimble 包管理器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem/nimble-package-manager"},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-networking","title":"Nim 异步与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem/async-networking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nim-use-cases","title":"Nim 应用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem/nim-use-cases"}]}]}